{"id":"a9531c0121171387","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-separation-property.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive3 Separation Property","display":"df-zfc-descriptive3-separation-property — ZFC Descriptive3 Separation Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-separation-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive3-separation-property"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive3-separation-property — ZFC Descriptive3 Separation Property","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-separation-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-separation-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive3-separation-property — ZFC Descriptive3 Separation Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3169dc41990b4bbe\" href=\"?note=3169dc41990b4bbe\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal B\\in V,\\ \\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(X,\\mathcal B\\in V,\\ \\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in V,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in V,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3SeparationProperty}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3SeparationProperty}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3169dc41990b4bbe\" href=\"?note=3169dc41990b4bbe\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}separation\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3SeparationProperty}_S(X,\\mathcal B,\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\mathcal B)\\land\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\Gamma\\;\\Bigl(A\\cap B=\\varnothing\\to\\exists C\\in\\Delta\\;(A\\subseteq C\\land B\\subseteq X\\setminus C)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}separation\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3SeparationProperty}_S(X,\\mathcal B,\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\mathcal B)\\land\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\Gamma\\;\\Bigl(A\\cap B=\\varnothing\\to\\exists C\\in\\Delta\\;(A\\subseteq C\\land B\\subseteq X\\setminus C)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> are set-coded sections on the same standard Borel space <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>; a member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> separates each disjoint pair from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"3169dc41990b4bbe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"3169dc41990b4bbe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal B\\in V,\\ \\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in V,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3SeparationProperty}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}separation\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3SeparationProperty}_S(X,\\mathcal B,\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\mathcal B)\\land\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\Gamma\\;\\Bigl(A\\cap B=\\varnothin